  "content": "<html><body>\n<h1>更好的附魔书</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/8f7bf0e6e88d05370d84e38c6e02ba80980a93f1.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/8f7bf0e6e88d05370d84e38c6e02ba80980a93f1.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>更好的附魔书</strong>是一个资源包，它为每种附魔都提供了独特的纹理 —— 并且始终保持<strong>干净且忠实于原版风格</strong>。</p>\n<p>设计注重清晰性和沉浸感，每种纹理都能直观表达附魔的作用，同时不偏离Minecraft的视觉风格。</p>\n<p>在<strong>Minecraft 1.21.5+</strong>中<strong>无需任何依赖</strong>！</p>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>游戏版本</th>\n<th>依赖项</th>\n<th>特殊大型附魔书</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.5+</td>\n<td>✅ 无需依赖</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.2 – 1.21.4</td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvariants-cit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Variants-CIT</a></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.1 及以下</td>\n<td>OptiFine 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>预览</h2>\n<h3>防护类</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/32e7fbb8c13ca131ab3f1265a7b1ab463aa9b813.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/32e7fbb8c13ca131ab3f1265a7b1ab463aa9b813.png\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/24007c7b10f217eabfbbecb78d5a9db7ec5226e5.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/24007c7b10f217eabfbbecb78d5a9db7ec5226e5.png\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/12ff47a96a54c96f659cdef6961e338a23447767.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/12ff47a96a54c96f659cdef6961e338a23447767.png\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/6b51ffe25a17e510a20bcf0798682d888a1d8997.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/6b51ffe25a17e510a20bcf0798682d888a1d8997.png\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https: