rinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/b001d105fe2f34735d6802d75aec8924f1a32e1c.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/b001d105fe2f34735d6802d75aec8924f1a32e1c.png\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/534d080abbef68f0bc32bf9a610deb1761a6d608.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/534d080abbef68f0bc32bf9a610deb1761a6d608.png\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/9e355df95cb7750bdf8fed375821cc931042aa70.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/9e355df95cb7750bdf8fed375821cc931042aa70.png\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>默认多合一附魔</td>\n<td>不可能多合一附魔</td>\n<td>诅咒多合一附魔</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>多合一附魔（1.21.5+）</h2>\n</body></html>当一本书包含不同的附魔时，纹理取决于所包含的附魔。<br>\n如果附魔属于同一类别，那么这本书将具有该类别的大书纹理：<table><thead><tr><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/32e7fbb8c13ca131ab3f1265a7b1ab463aa9b813.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/32e7fbb8c13ca131ab3f1265a7b1ab463aa9b813.png\"></th><th><strong>+</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/d3b8aa14f11d1edb15e011aeab0c38501ba44566.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/d3b8aa14f11d1edb15e011aeab0c38501ba44566.png\"></th><th><strong>=</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/4fd6758c9359b158f63781676f00de72fb1fb13d.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/4fd6758c9359b158f63781676f00de72fb1fb13d.png\"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Protection</td><td></td><td>Feather falling</td><td></td><td>Big protection book</td></tr></tbody></table>它还与特殊附魔一起使用：<table><thead><tr><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/76acc005717c7e7a34d097b35c299dd881144dd7.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/76acc005717c7e7a34d097b35c299dd881144dd7.png\"></th><th><strong>+</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/c0d1bfdd18aa6aae59819dc4bffeb7e1e272e1cc.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/c0d1bfdd18aa6aae59819dc4bffeb7e1e272e1cc.png\"></th><th><strong>=</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/2dbd8b8aa4d46da23435ae96d452e46e809e3105.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/2dbd8b8aa4d46da23435ae96d452e46e809e3105.png\"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sharpness</td><td></td><td>Unbreaking</td><td></td><td>Big sword book</td></tr></tbody></table>如果一本书有多个不同类别的附魔，那么这本书采用默认的大书纹理：<table><thead><tr><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/76acc005717c7e7a34d097b35c299dd881144dd7.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/76acc005717c7e7a34d097b35c299dd881144dd7.png\"></th><th><strong>+</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/32e7fbb8c13ca131ab3f1265a7b1ab463aa9b813.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/32e7fbb8c13ca131ab3f1265a7b1ab463aa9b813.png\"></th><th><strong>=</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/b001d105fe2f34735d6802d75aec8924f1a32e1c.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/b001d105fe2f34735d6802d75aec8924f1a32e1c.png\"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sharpness</td><td></td><td>Protection</td><td></td><td>Big default enchanted book</td></tr></tbody></table>如果书包括诅咒附魔，它将自动采用大诅咒书的纹理：<table><thead><tr><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/76acc005717c7e7a34d097b35c299dd881144dd7.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/76acc005717c7e7a34d097b35c299dd881144dd7.png\"></th><th><strong>+</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/4f7146f0dc9f0ddc778da4b41bd5077a5c5ad0c9.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/4f7146f0dc9f0ddc778da4b41bd5077a5c5ad0c9.png\"></th><th><strong>=</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/9e355df95cb7750bdf8fed375821cc931042aa70.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/9e355df95cb7750bdf8fed375821cc931042aa70.png\"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sharpness</td><td></td><td>Vanishing curse</td><td></td><td>Big curse book</td></tr></tbody></table>最后，如果书的附魔组合是不可能实现的，它将采用大不可能书的纹理：<table><thead><tr><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/9e51b4899ab98229731c658e09514c362f05a9ad.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/9e51b4899ab98229731c658e09514c362f05a9ad.png\"></th><th><strong>+</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/8f7f11a313665e7bf1e521b60a2fbe9dd8500e5b.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/8f7f11a313665e7bf1e521b60a2fbe9dd8500e5b.png\"></th><th><strong>=</strong></th><th><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/534d080abbef68f0bc32bf9a610deb1761a6d608.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/GTf4s4Fw/images/534d080abbef68f0bc32bf9a610deb1761a6d608.png\"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mending</td><td></td><td>Infinity</td><td></td><td>Big impossible book</td></tr></tbody></h2>安装 <ol><li>下载适合您的 Minecraft 版本的资源包</li><li>将其放入您的 <code>resourcepacks</code> 文件夹中</li><li>确保您有正确的 CIT 加载器（如果需要）（见上表）</li></ol>",
